### Get paginated products
GET http://localhost:8117/api/products?page=0&size=10

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:8117/api/products/1

### Search products
GET http://localhost:8117/api/products/search?name=Laptop&minPrice=1000&maxPrice=3000

### Get product summaries
GET http://localhost:8117/api/products/summaries?name=Laptop

### Create product
POST http://localhost:8117/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Laptop",
  "price": 2500,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:8117/api/products/1
